OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal movement restricted as
OL,4,Abluetongue spreads in south Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FTemporary restrictions are being
OL,7,Fintroduced on the movement of animals
OL,8,Fin Dumfries and Galloway to prevent the
OL,9,Fspread of the potentially deadly
OL,10,Fbluetongue virus.
OL,12,FSix farms, external, including one in
OL,13,FLockerbie, have recorded cases after a
OL,14,Flamb 54 miles (87km) away in Creetown
OL,15,Fbecame the first case in Scotland
OL,16,Fearlier this month.
OL,18,FExperts believe strong winds blew a
OL,19,Fplume of virus-spreading midges into
OL,20,FScotland from England.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
