OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal movement restricted as
OL,4,Abluetongue spreads in south Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe restrictions mean that all movement
OL,7,Fof animals susceptible to the virus -
OL,8,Fpredominantly sheep, cattle and goats -
OL,9,Fcan only take place under licence.
OL,10,FThere will also be more surveillance
OL,11,Fand testing of animals nearby.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
